  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: '_Annotation: ;ok weird thought;thinking this passage to the windmill could be removed:;reasons:;1. windmill is kind of cluttered right now;2. the reason this passage originally existed was to;    dump the player near the checkpoint. With the shortcut;    by the sewers entrance, this might just not be necessary.;3. sewer access at night should be more tightly gated.;;Things the passage should do if it remains...;    a) educate on lantern lighting dark spaces;    b) educate on lantern combat use;... and these things could just be done in the earlier little;dark shortcut/secret passage.... although if the player dies;they''ll just not learn anything, go back to the checkpoint, and;not really have any reason to come back here.'
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 0
