--- !u!114 &9366
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1086}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92ef9c18c70f83cc07d605ae28bc86f2, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  OnlyShowWhenPlayerIsNear: 1
  ShowDistance: 4.64
  DesignerOnly: 1
  message: "<align=\"left\"><size=11><color=green>\nok weird thought\nthinking this passage to the windmill could be removed:\nreasons:\n1. windmill is kind of cluttered right now\n2. the reason this passage originally existed was to\n    dump the player near the checkpoint. With the shortcut\n    by the sewers entrance, this might just not be necessary.\n3. sewer access at night should be more tightly gated.\n\nThings the passage <i>should do</i> if it remains...\n    a) educate on lantern lighting dark spaces\n    b) educate on lantern combat use\n... and these things could just be done in the earlier little\ndark shortcut/secret passage.... although if the player dies\nthey'll just not learn anything, go back to the checkpoint, and\nnot really have any reason to come back here."
